menuconfig ARCH_UMS9117
	bool "Unisoc UMS9117/T117"
	depends on ARCH_MULTI_V7
	select ARM_GIC
	select CLKSRC_MMIO
	select SPRD_TIMER
	help
	  Minimal Device Tree support for RAM-booted UMS9117/T117 systems:
	  a single Cortex-A7 with a GIC-400 behind ARCH_MULTI_V7. The port
	  inherits the clock, PHY and regulator state left by the BootROM/FDL
	  download path and performs no cold-start power sequencing. The 1 ms
	  AP system counter provides the clocksource, the 32 kHz AON timer
	  the clockevent, and the ARM architected timer stays disabled
	  because it reads zero on this SoC.
